abstract: >-
  An exact computer-assisted proof of Furter's R(3,n) for every
  1 <= n <= 299, together with a fixed-prime obstruction and a
  machine-readable Universal R(3) Challenge.
keywords:
  - polynomial composition rigidity
  - Polydegree Conjecture
  - Strong Factorial Conjecture
  - computer-assisted proof
  - computational commutative algebra
